EwjjuMiDyNKWAxXIQfUHHR2hFhkQ3IcHCJYBKAk",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjjuMiDyNKWAxXIQfUHHR2hFhkQ3YcHCJkBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjjuMiDyNKWAxXIQfUHHR2hFhkQ3IcHCJgBKAo",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["台北公館商圈，這家拉麵店很多年了，座位算多，來過幾次都可以直接入座，等待餐點上桌約 5~7分鐘，下午沒休息，用餐後自己放回餐具。老闆來自日本東京，在台南也有店。日籍老闆覺得台灣拉麵價位偏高，所以本店走平價路線。照片是地獄拉麵。個人沒有調整口味，只是認為叉燒偏薄。我喜歡厚切，炙烤過的叉燒，不過如果要求這樣的厚切叉燒，單價也會高。總之，在學校附近商圈，走平價路線，也不能要求過多，畢竟食材也是一分錢一分貨。",null,[0,202]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4019212541208112473/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXVjJWR2JGcE9SemswVWtoSmRGa3hhREZOYTA1T1ZWUnNTMkpWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7052,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WV2VGbFpORzk0UkhJdFkxaDFNa05OVVRsS2JVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x9c2728e82753a993!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnVWeFlZNG94RHItY1h1MkNNU